  "content": "<div><div><div><div><p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 14px;\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/LEGENDS_RPG_&amp;_DUNGEONS/MP_LEGENDS_Header.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2380\" height=\"874\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">踏入 <strong>Legends（传说）</strong>，一个充满冒险、战斗与探索的动作 <strong>RPG</strong> 整合包。潜入无数地牢，那里潜伏着危险的怪物和强大的Boss。<br>装备传奇武器和盔甲，提升技能，像真正的英雄一样迎接每一个挑战。<br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/LEGENDS_RPG_&amp;_DUNGEONS/MP_LEGENDS_Description.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2382\" height=\"236\"></span></p><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">欢迎来到 Legends（传说），一个沉浸式 RPG 体验，专注于地牢探险、怪物猎杀和史诗级成长。探索充满程序生成地牢的广阔世界，每个地牢都遍布敌人、陷阱和稀有战利品。<br>面对守护着强大宝藏的独特 Boss，在每一场战斗中测试你的实力。<br>传奇武器、附魔盔甲和神秘神器将助你生存。<br>准备战斗、探索并征服——你的传说从现在开始。</span></div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px; font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\"><strong>想和朋友一起玩？</strong></span></span></p><p><a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/thewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/LEGENDS_RPG_&amp;_DUNGEONS/MP_LEGENDS_Promo.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2382\" height=\"353\"></strong></a></p><div><div><p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif; font-size: 18px;\"><a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/thewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">立即获取你自己的 Minecraft 服务器</a></span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">，与朋友一起享受无尽的冒险！凭借顶级性能和可靠在线时间，我们的服务器确保每个人都能获得流畅有趣的游戏体验。使用代码 <a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/thewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">THEWIZARD </a>即可享受 </span></strong><a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/thewizard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: book antiqua, palatino, serif;\">七五折优惠！</span></strong></a></span></span></p></div></div></div><div>&nbsp;</div></div></div></div>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/LEGENDS_RPG_&amp;_DUNGEONS/MP_LEGENDS_Screenshots.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"2382\" height=\"235\"></span>\n\n![](https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1262091/description_0d997e60-6745-426c-8b2d-2bc7e7ac1c56.png)\n\n![](https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1262091/description_5aeeaf75-139f-4c6d-bf85-aa87ad527205.png)\n\n![](https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1262091/description_59b76080-933c-4ede-89cf-69a6484260c6.png)\n\n[![](https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/LEGENDS_RPG_&_DUNGEONS/MP_LEGENDS_Discord.webp)](https://discord.gg/FqhuAjYTGv)",
